- **Delivery smoke automation (`auto-tests/`)**: [auto-tests/README.md](../../auto-tests/README.md) — pytest + Playwright smoke (not [automation/](../../automation/) harness tools); **``** session mode — [docs/auto-tests-contract.json](../../docs/auto-tests-contract.json); specs under **`auto-tests/specs/`**; manual epic drafts stay under **`epics/`** and **`TEST-PREP:`**
- **Epic orchestrator (`/epic-helper`)**: [docs/epic-helper-contract.json](../../docs/epic-helper-contract.json) **v5**; two human gates (env, coverage_review + **scenario_groups[]**); discover → test_prep → close per [docs/draft-truth-contract.json](../../docs/draft-truth-contract.json)

Align new test case drafts with [epics/templates/tests-ref.json](../../epics/templates/tests-ref.json) / **dr-ref** unless the task defines a different format. Epic Smart Checklist drafts follow **coverage.md**. Epic regression bundles follow **test-prep.md** after coverage exists.

**JSON inspection:** Agents **MUST** use **`jq`** per [automation/docs/jq.md](../../automation/docs/jq.md) before loading large epic or harness `*.json` into context (see [jq-json.mdc](jq-json.mdc)).

