Manual **Python tests and tools** for the **harness** (not delivery smoke). Tool docs: [automation/docs/](automation/docs/) (e.g. Yogi). Agent playbooks: [`.cursor/pipelines/`](../pipelines/). Executable smoke: [auto-tests/](../../auto-tests/).

- **Jira Structure formulas** (paste deploy, not epic pipelines): [docs/jira-structure-contract.json](../../docs/jira-structure-contract.json) · [automation/structure/](../../automation/structure/) (roadmap QA RA/TC/CR/Validation, QA End Date, QA Est) · [automation/docs/jira-structure.md](../../automation/docs/jira-structure.md)

